$230^{\circ}$ lies in Q3, where cosine is negative.

$\begin{aligned}A&=230^{\circ}-180^{\circ}\\&=50^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

$\cos 230^{\circ}=-\cos 50^{\circ}$

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=20mm,y=20mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},draw=black]
\draw[<->] (-1.3,0)--(1.3,0);
\draw[<->] (0,-1.3)--(0,1.3);
\draw (0,0) circle (1);
\draw[thick] (0,0)--(230:1);
\fill (230:1) circle (1.5pt);
\draw[->] (0.38,0) arc[start angle=0,end angle=230,radius=0.38];
\draw[->] (-0.62,0) arc[start angle=180,end angle=230,radius=0.62];
\node at (0.2,0.65) {$230^{\circ}$};
\node at (-0.8,-0.25) {$50^{\circ}$};
\node[right] at (1.3,0) {$x$};
\node[above] at (0,1.3) {$y$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$240^{\circ}=180^{\circ}+60^{\circ}$, so the acute reference angle is $60^{\circ}$. In Q3, sine and cosine are negative; tangent is positive.

(a) $\begin{aligned}\sin 240^{\circ}&=-\sin 60^{\circ}\\&=-\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\end{aligned}$

(b) $\begin{aligned}\cos 240^{\circ}&=-\cos 60^{\circ}\\&=-\frac{1}{2}\end{aligned}$

(c) $\begin{aligned}\tan 240^{\circ}&=\tan 60^{\circ}\\&=\sqrt{3}\end{aligned}$

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=20mm,y=20mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},draw=black]
\draw[<->] (-1.3,0)--(1.3,0);
\draw[<->] (0,-1.3)--(0,1.3);
\draw (0,0) circle (1);
\draw[thick] (0,0)--(240:1);
\fill (240:1) circle (1.5pt);
\draw[->] (0.38,0) arc[start angle=0,end angle=240,radius=0.38];
\draw[->] (-0.62,0) arc[start angle=180,end angle=240,radius=0.62];
\node at (0.2,0.65) {$240^{\circ}$};
\node at (-0.8,-0.3) {$60^{\circ}$};
\node[right] at (1.3,0) {$x$};
\node[above] at (0,1.3) {$y$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$315^{\circ}=360^{\circ}-45^{\circ}$, so the acute reference angle is $45^{\circ}$. In Q4, cosine is positive; sine and tangent are negative.

(a) $\begin{aligned}\sin 315^{\circ}&=-\sin 45^{\circ}\\&=-\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}\end{aligned}$

(b) $\begin{aligned}\cos 315^{\circ}&=\cos 45^{\circ}\\&=\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}\end{aligned}$

(c) $\begin{aligned}\tan 315^{\circ}&=-\tan 45^{\circ}\\&=-1\end{aligned}$

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=20mm,y=20mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},draw=black]
